{"title":"2022 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/4/8e422ea624f4cc14204e47ec836017b740d90c3d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot\\frac{2}{4}\\cdot\\frac{3}{5}\\cdots\\frac{18}{20}\\cdot\\frac{19}{21}\\cdot\\frac{20}{22}?\\]\" width=\"191\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2cd6cbc287f3b55e0f60488ab663f75a4a5c732.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\frac{1}{462} \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{1}{231} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\frac{1}{132} \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{2}{213} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\frac{1}{22}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"457\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that common factors (from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d859b55509f630845eb1bec092041feb5b3fe460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" /> inclusive) of the numerator and the denominator cancel. Therefore, the original expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/3/223017c5281b22f6c831d21b4c389a60b0d57a19.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{\\cancel{3}}\\cdot\\frac{2}{\\cancel{4}}\\cdot\\frac{\\cancel{3}}{\\cancel{5}}\\cdots\\frac{\\cancel{18}}{\\cancel{20}}\\cdot\\frac{\\cancel{19}}{21}\\cdot\\frac{\\cancel{20}}{22}=\\frac{1\\cdot2}{21\\cdot22}=\\frac{1}{21\\cdot11}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } \\frac{1}{231}}.\\]\" width=\"444\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The original expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/6/da6e9d851413902746f298d75123fb091283402b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{20!}{22!/2!} = \\frac{20! \\cdot 2!}{22!} = \\frac{20! \\cdot 2}{20! \\cdot 21 \\cdot 22} = \\frac{2}{21 \\cdot 22} = \\frac{1}{21 \\cdot 11} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } \\frac{1}{231}}.\\]\" width=\"501\" height=\"48\" />\n~hh99754539\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=997\">https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=997</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=FHon9G492KY6Ecf3&amp;t=996\">https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=FHon9G492KY6Ecf3&amp;t=996</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vr7hf7IK2po\">https://youtu.be/vr7hf7IK2po</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=565\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=565</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/1xspUFoKDnU?t=176\">https://youtu.be/1xspUFoKDnU?t=176</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Zgs4B6ajyOY\">https://youtu.be/Zgs4B6ajyOY</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"